      Snare "....X.....g.X.......X.......X.......X.......X.......X.....g.X.......X.......X.......X.......X.......X.....g.X.......X.......X..."
      Hat "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
